#: toplevel.cpp:130
msgid ""
"<p>Do you want to generate a backtrace? This will help the developers to "
"figure out what went wrong.</p>\n"
"<p>Unfortunately this will take some time on slow machines.</p><p><b>Note: A "
"backtrace is not a substitute for a proper description of the bug and "
"information on how to reproduce it. It is not possible to fix the bug "
"without a proper description.</b></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Ba.n co' muo^'n sinh backtrace? No' se~ giu'p cho ca'c nha` pha't trie^?n "
"ti`m ra nguye^n nha^n ga^y ra crash</p>\n"
"<p>DDa'ng tie^'c la` ddie^`u na`y se~ kha' ma^'t tho+`i gian vo+'i  ca'c ma'y ti'nh cu~.</p> "
"<p><b> Chu' y': Backtrace kho^ng the^? thay the^' ddu+o+.c nhu+~ng mo^ ta? lo^~i "
"chi'nh xa'c. Kho^ng the^? fix bug ne^'u kho^ng co' mo^ ta? lo^~i ch'nh xa'c"

